# Frontend (React)

Full detail: fresno-events `.cursor/rules/frontend-architecture.mdc` and dev-space `AGENT_RULES.md` §8.

- `components/` — reusable UI; `features/` — domain modules; `pages/` — route shells
- `api/` or `services/` — HTTP only; components never call `fetch` directly
- Dependency direction: pages → features → components (never reverse)
- No boolean prop variants — use explicit variant components
- Pure logic in `Feature.utils.ts` with unit tests
